sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant WasteRecord as WasteRecord
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+WasteRecord: voidRecord(reason)
    Note over WasteRecord: Policies: wasteRecordRead, wasteRecordWrite, wasteRecordExecute
    Note over WasteRecord: Guards (4)
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;recorded#quot;
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: guard[1]: self.recordedAt != null
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: guard[2]: self.deletedAt == null
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: guard[3]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;inventoryManageAccess#quot;)
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: mutate.status
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: mutate.voidedAt
    WasteRecord->>WasteRecord: mutate.voidReason
    WasteRecord->>EventBus: emit WasteVoided on waste_record.voided
    WasteRecord-->>-Client: void